<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea raises domestic gasoline prices by 12 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea raises domestic gasoline prices by 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Ministry of Finance and Economy announced on Friday it would increase domestic gasoline prices by 12 percent to 815 won a litre from 727 won, effective on Saturday.</p>
</text>
